{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed for grades 6-8th, Infinilearn is a full retro-style MMORPG to help you MASTER whatever math problem you may encounter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here's how Infinilearn works</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Create a custom &quot;hero&quot; that represents you</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Progress throughout the story</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Encounter fierce enemies, complete math problems to deal damage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Join and battle friends</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We aren't just another middle school math app. We want to empower every student to be fully confident in their math abilities while having fun. The app with adapt to your personal level and support you throughout your learning journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All math problems are fully aligned to state standards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What are you waiting for? Ready to have fun while learning?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Questions? Feedback? Email us: <a href=\"mailto:adrian@infinilearn.com\">adrian@infinilearn.com</a></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3513130?t=1768432096","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3513130?t=1768432096","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513130/29b2dd3fc393f581e6b33331ae8a0b51cba85586/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768432096","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513130/29b2dd3fc393f581e6b33331ae8a0b51cba85586/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768432096","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"MMO","id":20},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76}